			(property "Description" "Analog Thumb Joystick\n\nThis is a joystick very similar to the ‘analog’ joysticks on PS2 (PlayStation 2) controllers. Directional movements are simply two potentiometers - one for each axis. Pots are ~10k each. This joystick also has a select button that is actuated when the joystick is pressed down.\n\nSparkFun Products\n\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/9032 Thumb Joystick (COM-09032)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/9110 SparkFun Thumb Joystick Breakout (BOB-09110)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/9760 SparkFun Joystick Shield Kit (DEV-09760)"
